      10 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">استوبا</span></b>  (S, K,) and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">توبّأ</span></b>  (TA) <i>He found,</i>
or <i>deemed,</i> a country, (S, K,) or water, (TA,)
<i>unhealthy,</i> or <i>unwholesome:</i> (K, TA:) [see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَبَأٌ</span>:]
or, <i>much afflicted with disease.</i> (S.)

